{
  "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan",
  "chapter": 3,
  "act": 3,
  "scene": "hanyuan",
  "palette": "gold",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "liqinghe",
    "shenheng",
    "tangjian",
    "hetaihou",
    "wenqiao"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "公开双方已经办成与尚未办成的事，以有限人手选择补证取舍",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l1",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "交凭呢，唐典记？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l2",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "两张长案拼到一起，案脚高低不齐。唐垫进薄木片，水碗才不往一侧滑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l3",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "收好了，刚从掖庭走过来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l4",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "先放着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l5",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "月前榜上那三项：钱的来处、递件到人、错办追核。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l6",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "hetaihou",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "三项各录双方实据，得两项支持者奏请授位。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l7",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两项。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l8",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "hetaihou",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "陛下准的是这三项，不能临场再添一道题。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l9",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "度支核账官、别署录事、外署校案官分别入席。三人都交了无亲故的回避牒。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "各席只核自己那一项，具名写明理由。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我宣读，太后监议，都不另投一票。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我只交经手凭据，不入评议席。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l14",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "沈衡……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "候选差是撤了，往来却仍在，不能算没这回事。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l16",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我的亲署也退席，预算交给别人来问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l17",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "也好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l18",
      "when": {
        "flag.nomination_joint_review": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "三处联署的核签钱付了，无署可荐的仍进不来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l19",
      "when": {
        "flag.nomination_joint_review": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "无署可荐的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l20",
      "when": {
        "flag.nomination_open_questions": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "限期试问能自递，远处人的盘缠却还没补足。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l21",
      "when": {
        "flag.nomination_open_questions": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "盘缠。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l22",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两条都留。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l23",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "无荐者留自递，路远的留代递。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l24",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "代递？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l25",
      "when": {
        "ming": {
          "gte": 6
        },
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你问过“你的钱呢”。这回代递的工钱，从哪儿出？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l26",
      "when": {
        "ming": {
          "gte": 6
        },
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我记得。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l27",
      "when": {
        "ming": {
          "lt": 6
        },
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "代递的工钱从哪儿出？观里不能再替你接这一回。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l28",
      "when": {
        "ming": {
          "lt": 6
        },
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "观里……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l29",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不从观里抽人，从扩办的钱里出。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l30",
      "when": {
        "flag.nvguan_halfday_pay": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "观中半日校读已照约结钱，不能再算待调的人手。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l31",
      "when": {
        "flag.nvguan_halfday_pay": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这一栏。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l32",
      "when": {
        "flag.nvguan_trip_pay": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "观中按次验封已结钱，不能再算待调的人手。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l33",
      "when": {
        "flag.nvguan_trip_pay": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这一栏。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l34",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我的十页核完了，钱也收了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l35",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l36",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "颂文撤了。“已经有衣”那句话，别再拿去招人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l37",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "回执在这，十页的钱另列。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l38",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "让我看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l39",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_2": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "柳承欢接了三夜，省的工费在这一页。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l40",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_2": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l41",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_2": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她失去的三日休也得计，不能当零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l42",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_2": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "三夜另雇两人，工费已经支了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l43",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_2": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l44",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_2": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你亲做的半日交班，不能再算作备议。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l45",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两处错牒，底簿记的是柳承欢核出。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l46",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l47",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "摘要合记总办，可不能就算你亲核。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l48",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "合记，是我准的。这句留在问答里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l49",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l50",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_3": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "底簿、摘要都记柳承欢经手，你只署总办。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l51",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_3": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "在这里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l52",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_3": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "逐项的功，没有合到你名下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l53",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "核账官用指背碰了碰未盖印的一栏。李将那页从自己面前转过去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l54",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我的扩办款要等下月合署拨付，眼前只保两处轮值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l55",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "下月。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l56",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那两处，已经有人递到？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l57",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "回执在这，没有代递的地方也圈了，不能当全开。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l58",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "给我看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l59",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "李令仪的异议答复核过一轮，原件可查。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l60",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "再核，要多久？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l61",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "限三日，但跨署追签还没试过。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l62",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "追签……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l63",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我的不利页，本人已经回签。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l64",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今夜再对原件，就得占两个人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l65",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两个人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l66",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我的不利页还只收了件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l67",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "核证人已出署，终议前补不齐那轮签。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l68",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那轮签。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l69",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "原定六处若缩成两处，余钱够眼前开支，也够办实代递。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l70",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两处……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l71",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "可六处都有人等着来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l72",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l73",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "得逐处告延期，两名复核人也得出去验代递。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l74",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我若让两人验完再回来——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l75",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "等等，今日只够走一趟。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l76",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "一趟。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l77",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "去了外头，今夜就不能留在案前对原件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l78",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你两处能自递也能代递，我只有轮值，办实了便比我多一步。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l79",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l80",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "也可只补钱，或只补代递，留两人在这里核卷。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l81",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "慢些。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l82",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没补的那项，照原样记。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l83",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你已交逐人回签，留下的人能核全前后两版。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l84",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "前后两版。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l85",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "比只查原件，多一层经手可追。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l86",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你缺的却是出署之人的签，只留核卷人还不够。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l87",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那个人……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l88",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不能让在场的人替他认字。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l89",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "hetaihou",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "若不愿缩六处，也可照原案送，留人核卷。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l90",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "照原案。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l91",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "hetaihou",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "只是案上写下六处，不等于眼前就有钱可付。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l92",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "已领来的，不退给人等。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l93",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "新增的四处？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l94",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "若要缓……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l95",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l96",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "逐处写明再议的时限。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l97",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "门外两名受雇复核人等着领差。日影已移到门槛，她们今天只够走一趟。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l98",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "三席各把可核的凭据列好了，今日就按你选的支出办。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l99",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我还在看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l100",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "明早照实核，不补空票。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l101",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（钱不是多出来的。拿给这一处，另一处就得等。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l102",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "几份支出，都给我。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l103",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "唐将本月余款与下月拟拨的两页分开，指尖压住月份。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l104",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "合署的款未到，两处先支哪笔？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l105",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你看月份。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l106",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "已核的本月余款。下月才拨的，不能充今日。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l107",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "本月。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l108",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我也借不到下一月的钱，两处以外的人今日仍得等。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l109",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那其余的……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l110",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两笔分开列。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l111",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两笔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l112",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "别把今日下月读成一笔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l113",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "唐将两页并排放下，没有往支持栏添字。"
    }
  ],
